  @Nat.Prime.coprime_iff_not_dvd : Nat.Prime p → (p.Coprime n ↔ ¬p ∣ n)
  @Nat.Coprime.pow : ∀ {k l} (m n : ℕ), k.Coprime l → (k^m).Coprime (l^n)
  @Nat.Coprime.dvd_of_dvd_mul_right : k.Coprime n → k ∣ m * n → k ∣ m
  @Finsupp.le_def, @Finsupp.single_eq_same, Nat.eq_zero_or_pos

Diagnosis: S3's "n·s ≥ 2" is proved by the coprime route rather than the
factorization computation — `m^2 ∣ (m^s·R)^n` plus `Nat.Coprime (m^2) (R^n)`
(from `Nat.Prime.coprime_iff_not_dvd` + `Coprime.pow`) cancels `R^n` via
`dvd_of_dvd_mul_right`, and `Nat.pow_dvd_pow_iff_le_right` turns
`m^2 ∣ m^s·n` into `2 ≤ s·n`. This needs no Finsupp-level computation.

